{'symbol': 'CB', 'date': '2021-11-15 17:15:00', 'title': 'CHUBB LIMITED ANNOUNCES PRICING OF $1.6 BILLION SENIOR NOTES OFFERING BY SUBSIDIARY', 'text': 'ZURICH, NOV. 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CHUBB LIMITED (NYSE: CB) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS SUBSIDIARY, CHUBB INA HOLDINGS INC., HAS PRICED A PUBLIC OFFERING OF $600 MILLION OF 2.85% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2051 AND $1.0 BILLION OF 3.05% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2061. THE NOTES ARE GUARANTEED BY CHUBB LIMITED.'}